          "status": "absent",
          "evidence": "FSM software for trade contractors operates in an unregulated environment. ServiceTitan requires no government licenses, sector certifications, or regulatory approvals to offer its platform. Its publicly listed status (Nasdaq: TTAN) adds financial disclosure requirements but creates no entry barrier for software competitors. No patent enforcement actions are documented.",
