          "evidence": "ServiceTitan is the category-defining brand in enterprise FSM software. Its IPO on Nasdaq (TTAN) in December 2024 at approximately $6.3B valuation cemented its public market position. It is the recognized authority in HVAC, plumbing, and electrical verticals — the brand buyers in those segments name first when asked about FSM software. Third-party moat analyses explicitly cite its brand as a competitive advantage. Dominant in analyst reports and trade publication coverage of the category.",
