          "id": "network_effects",
          "status": "absent",
          "evidence": "Jobber is a scheduling and FSM platform for SMB home service businesses. The product manages individual businesses' own teams and customers — more businesses joining Jobber does not make the product better for any existing customer. There is no marketplace connecting buyers to service providers, no shared knowledge base that improves per-user value with scale, and no protocol or compatibility dynamic. The AI Receptionist and AI Campaign Generator (launched August-September 2025) add functionality but derive value from each business's own data, not from the network.",
